-- Grants for the app role (chairside_app): read, add and change. Providers and treatment types are
-- made inactive, patients archived or anonymised, appointments cancelled: never deleted, so no
-- DELETE on them. A break, an opening-hours row or a closed day is simply removed. memberships
-- stays read-only (migration 0001): nobody links a person to a provider from the app yet.
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE ON "providers" TO chairside_app;
--> statement-breakpoint
